            "displayName": "Michael McCandless",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "body": "Thanks Dan!\n\nI committed to trunk and backported the test case to 3.x.  I had to add missing rd1/2.close() at the end of the test case.",
